{
  "schema_version": "2.0",
  "description": "V2 independent test set. Written after V1 was closed; the 14 V1 holdout cases are NOT reused here (they are a regression set only). Covers planning, multi-turn inheritance, relative parameter edits, clarification, shelter shutdown, comparison and error recovery.",
